To see an example 

00:03:37.768 --> 00:03:39.948
of an actual e-commerce company 

00:03:39.948 --> 00:03:42.648
that was able to improve their business practices 

00:03:42.648 --> 00:03:44.447
based on returns data, 

00:03:44.447 --> 00:03:46.864
check out our case study on Ecru, 

00:03:46.864 --> 00:03:48.430
a women’s fashion brand that 

00:03:48.430 --> 00:03:52.642
was able to cut their multi-size purchases by 15%.  

